'' RUN: a 'dim shared' initialiser holding the ADDRESS of a procedure this module only
'' declares -- through an 'extern "c"' alias, a plain declare, a private procedure named
'' by nothing else, and an address among data. The variable's pointer words declared
'' nothing, so clang refused the module ("use of undefined value"), and the private one
'' was dropped as unreferenced. Four modules of tiko-rt are this shape. Output identical
'' to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/global-init-proc-addr/main.bas tests/codegen/src/global-init-proc-addr/other.bas -o tests/codegen/globalinitprocaddr.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: undefined value
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/globalinitprocaddr.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/globalinitprocaddr.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: alias 21
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: plain 300
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: private 9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: mixed 500
